            "answer": "<p>Choose 314Ah when 2,010W covers your simultaneous load and you want 1,075.2Wh / 36.5% more reserve in the same 522 × 268 × 222mm enclosure. Choose 230Ah when 2,944Wh covers your time between charges and you want 2,560W continuous output, 5.4kg less weight and the lower current single-unit price. Test your devices in the <a href=\"/pages/power-calculator?scenario=rv\">Power Planner</a>.</p>"
